# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gson 反射序列化规则（cn.safebank.app.data.model 全部 DTO/VO 都靠字段名反射）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1) 保留泛型签名与注解（@SerializedName 运行时不可见则 snake_case 映射全丢）
-keepattributes Signature
-keepattributes *Annotation*
-keepattributes RuntimeVisibleAnnotations,RuntimeVisibleParameterAnnotations,AnnotationDefault
-keepattributes InnerClasses,EnclosingMethod

# 2) Models.kt：字段名/构造器/方法名一律不混淆、不裁剪。
#    注意 SafeBankJson 会用 getDeclaredConstructor() 反射创建"默认实例"，
#    从而让缺失字段保留 Kotlin 默认值（pendingAction={}、OFFLINE_DEMO chat 等都依赖它）。
-keep class cn.safebank.app.data.model.** { *; }
-keepclassmembers class cn.safebank.app.data.model.** {
    <fields>;
    <init>();
    <init>(...);
}

# 3) Gson 自身的泛型擦除辅助类型（TypeToken 子类需要保留泛型签名）
-keep class com.google.gson.reflect.TypeToken { *; }
-keep class * extends com.google.gson.reflect.TypeToken { *; }
-keepclassmembers,allowobfuscation class * {
    @com.google.gson.annotations.SerializedName <fields>;
}

# 4) 不因为 Gson/OkHttp 的可选依赖告警而中断 release 构建
-dontwarn com.google.gson.**
-dontwarn okhttp3.**
-dontwarn okio.**
-dontwarn org.conscrypt.**
-dontwarn org.bouncycastle.**
-dontwarn org.openjsse.**
